<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PERSETEL IN TALKS, ISSUES CAUTIONARY.</title>
<headline>PERSETEL IN TALKS, ISSUES CAUTIONARY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Persetel Holdings Ltd on Friday advised shareholders it was engaged in negotiations which, if successfully concluded, could have an effect on the company's shareprice.</p>
<p>Persetel advised shareholders to exercise caution in sharedealings. Another announcement would be made in due course.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
